# Rdragmap patch: portable Darwin hash-compressor semaphore
# Base: 7e012afc1007324f5be27916afe8da9edcd4940b
# Purpose: replace deprecated and unreliable Darwin sem_init/sem_destroy use
# with a process-local pthread mutex, condition variable, and counter while
# retaining POSIX unnamed semaphores on platforms that implement them.
# Regression: compile the hash compressor through the Apple code path, run the
# packaged tiny compressed-index mapping test, and require the macOS R CMD check
# job plus both clean native build variants to pass.

